  "remarks": "LLC Slavneft-Nizhnevartovsk is a company active in the Russian energy sector and a part of Slavneft. LLC Slavneft-Nizhnevartovsk engages in oil production. The energy sector, especially the oil and gas sectors, provides substantial revenues to the Government of the Russian Federation. Therefore, LLC Slavneft-Nizhnevartovsk is involved in an economic sector providing a substantial source of revenue to the Government of the Russian Federation, which is responsible for the annexation of Crimea and the destabilisation of Ukraine.",
